multinode-demo: add CoFDP launchers

multinode-demo/cofdp/{setup,bootstrap-validator,bench-tps}.sh are the upstream
scripts with the validator's ledger, accounts and snapshots placed in a
P-Directory ($COFDP_TENANT_ROOT/$COFDP_PDIR, default /home/femu/tenant0/p1),
and with the CoFDP defaults of bench-tps: --duration 1200 --tx-count 10000
--threads 8. The upstream scripts are not modified.

Base: solana-labs/solana tag v1.18.26
      (commit d9f20e951a06b61e4505da0955228020b96a8915)
Apply: git apply 0002-multinode-demo-cofdp-launchers.patch
